// typed_a9_check_rt.h: round A9's differential check (a9_typed_check.cpp, generated by tools/typed_lift2.py --check-tu;
// docs/decomp_a9.md). Only the check translation unit and the offline harness (tools/a9_harness.cpp) include it. Made from
// typed_a8_check_rt.h by renaming (build/a9w/mkcheck9.py: a8ck -> a9ck, A8_OFFLINE -> A9_OFFLINE, PS2X_A8_CHECK -> PS2X_A9_CHECK)
// plus the quat122 / geo126 cores on the leg's logged memory (a9x below, around the shared cores of typed_a9_core.h; the
// reference's call through refExt) and A9_NCHK's leg for those natives (the core on the native's entry state, then the native:
// its stores, f0 / v0 and every register the core says it leaves alone compared): the same check in its own namespace a9ck, the "[a9]" line; the typed runtime
// stubs (A6's libc / thread id, A7's printf family) on the leg's logged memory as A7's.
